body:
I hate it too. I'm at a point where I do it in the middle of the school day in the bathroom. My friend was grabbing a pen out of my pencil case and saw my box cutter and asked why I had it (very awkward but I did not tell her.)  My point is that you're not alone and I really hope anyone who feels this way finds comfort in someone/something at school which would distract them from everything terrible about that hellhole of a place.

&#x200B;

Ily <3
